#line 1 "EDITED.cbl"
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. EDITED.



 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 E1 PIC ZZ,ZZ9.99-.
 01 E2 PIC ***,**9.99.
 01 E3 PIC +++,++9.
 01 E4 PIC $$$,$$9.99CR.
 01 E5 PIC 9(3)B9(2)0/99.
 01 E6 PIC ZZZ.ZZ.
 01 E7 PIC -(5)9.
 01 E8 PIC $Z,ZZ9.99DB.
 01 V PIC S9(5)V99.
 01 K PIC 9.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
 PERFORM VARYING K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL K > 5
 EVALUATE K
 WHEN 1 MOVE 1234.5 TO V
 WHEN 2 MOVE -1234.5 TO V
 WHEN 3 MOVE 0 TO V
